      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IRANSOFAR (8) was well found in the market when resuming here 2 weeks ago in a similar field and was running on late for sixth after getting well back off a slow start. Daniel Moor picks up the ride, and with a better beginning, she can bounce back and take this out. XTRAVAGANT JOHNNY (6) flashed home too late when finishing runner-up by a nose on debut here a fortnight ago over 1000m. The extra 200m will make a difference, and he can go one better. METAL BOSS (4) was not far away on debut and then improved again when finishing second by a short head 17 days ago at The Sunshine Coast. This is not much tougher, and he is ready to win a race at short notice. WINNING HARLOW (10) showed some courage when finishing a game fourth on debut at Ipswich nearly 4 weeks ago. She will naturally improve off that run, and she can figure in the top 3 this time. ANDER'S DREAM (7) is back for her second campaign, and she will don the blinkers for the first time. Each-way value from a good gate.",
